[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m \[2^8 = (2^2)^x\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m Next, we use the property of exponents \((a^m)^n = a^{mn}\) to simplify the right side of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
