[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m To solve for \(x\), we divide both sides of the equation by 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m \[x = \frac{8}{2} = 4\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=724139)[0m 
